          "comment": "PRN pyramid jamming, starting with L1 from F8.1 Porcus Maior (for chiprates, see Testcatalog Table 5.25), then adding bands sequentially to G1, L2, L5, L6, B1I, E5b, G2. The test then continues by removing bands one by one in reverse order, until ending up with only L1. Each step lasts 5 minutes with 3 minutes of jamming and a 2 minutes break between each pyramid step.  In total, it will look like this: \n\nL1\nL1, G1\nL1, G1, L2\nL1, G1, L2, L5\nL1, G1, L2, L5, E6\nL1, G1, L2, L5, E6, B1I\nL1, G1, L2, L5, E6, B1I, E5b\nL1, G1, L2, L5, E6, B1I, E5b, G2\nL1, G1, L2, L5, E6, B1I, E5b\nL1, G1, L2, L5, E6, B1I\nL1, G1, L2, L5, E6\nL1, G1, L2, L5\nL1, G1, L2\nL1, G1\nL1",
